# The desk's own data. NEVER commit this.
#
# data/ holds the IndexedDB the front desk has been using, its backups and its
# log. A backup is readable JSON: borrower names, phone numbers and loan
# history in plain text. dist/data is the same thing for a machine that has run
# the app from dist/.
data/

# Build output. Regenerate with host/build.ps1 -- it needs nothing installed.
dist/

# The distributable. Regenerate with tools/package.ps1.
release/

# WebView2 assemblies: Microsoft's redistributables, not this project's source.
# host/fetch-deps.ps1 downloads the exact versions on a fresh clone, and
# host/lib/LICENSE.txt and NOTICE.txt are kept in the repo beside them.
host/lib/*.dll

# Node, only used by the test suites and the dev server.
node_modules/

# Compiler and editor noise.
*.pdb
*.user
.vs/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
